<title>USA: Fleet files shelf for $1 mln in securities.</title>
<headline>Fleet files shelf for $1 mln in securities.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Financial Group Inc said Monday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $1 million in debt and preferred securities.</p>
<p>The Boston, Mass., based company said the proceeds will be used general corporate purposes, principally to extend credit to, or fund investments in, its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Fleet is a diversified financial services company, engaged in general commercial banking and trust business.</p>
</text>
